“deemed
registration” means deemed registration as defined in
section 25;

“grant”, when used in relation to
registration, means grant, issue or otherwise confer
registration;

“labelling” of goods includes any means
by which, at the point of sale, information is attached to goods or is
displayed in relation to goods without being attached to them;

“participating
jurisdiction” has the meaning given by section
43;

“produce” includes to manufacture, and
also includes to harvest or otherwise produce in the course of any form of
primary production;

“requirements”, when used in relation to
goods, means requirements, prohibitions, restrictions or
conditions;

“substantive
registration” means registration under a law of a State,
but does not include deemed registration;

